{"id":"n20195-1-28","stage":0,"title":"노래 · 歌","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20195-1-28-1","ko":"방금 들은 노래 어때?","zh":"你刚听的歌怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들은","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노래","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"edcad1c9c3dba9e9","term":"노래","zh":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3","entryId":"20195","definition":"给具有韵律的歌词添加曲子的音乐；或放声唱出那样的音乐。","pronunciation":["노래"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3d99cae4441962229bc6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20195-1-28-2","ko":"음도 좋고 가사도 좋네.","zh":"曲子好听，歌词也很棒。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음도","meaning":"音、曲调","explanation":"음：音、曲调；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"음","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:음:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"음","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"좋고","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가사도","meaning":"歌词","explanation":"가사：歌词；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"가사","audio":"/audio/97fedec52eecf50994df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15399","senseId":"1","lemma":"가사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋네.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95e3c75cd502220b","term":"음","zh":"音、曲调","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3","definition":"本句谈歌曲的旋律，与歌词相对。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"97fedec52eecf509","term":"가사","zh":"歌词","audio":"/audio/97fedec52eecf50994df.mp3","entryId":"15399","definition":"伴以音乐唱出来的词句。","pronunciation":["가사"]}],"audio":"/audio/91bcb9a7a1c0a1dc658d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.837,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=20195","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":22,"sequenceScore":1.0642,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["曲子好听，歌词也很棒。","你刚听的歌怎么样？","哪里有这么好闻的味道啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你刚听的歌怎么样？","哪里有这么好闻的味道啊？","曲子好听，歌词也很棒。"],"answer":2}]}
